  "SHEET/ENGINE: mesh.pool === MurmurBus.pool reference math across 2400 every-20-round verifies in every mesh arm/seed/world — 0 mismatches (max |diff| 1.11e-16, tol 1e-9). Ration enforced by gate cells: preflight zeroInfluenceDiff=0.00e+0. Arena arms ran ZERO sheet cells — the direct-reward currency needs no pooled substrate; that asymmetry is the point.",
